85e5326c3de3298511afeb913fe733bdc56b552","logical_entry_identity":"1298e46cf2d6e6ac3b8f1a3f99f31fe0f7a219ae4400936b11610e2a0da7f6fa","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Surround yourself with a defensive aura, increasing armor by %d, and inflicting %0.2f fire and %0.2f blight damage to all attacking foes.\nAdditionally, your vim will enhance your defences, reducing all damage by %d%% of your current vim (currently %d), but never reducing by more than half of the original damage. This will cost vim equal to 5%% of the damage blocked.\nThe damage will scale with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"深渊气息围绕着你，增加 %d 点护甲，增加 %0.2f 点火焰、%0.2f 点枯萎近战反击伤害。\n\t同时你的活力会增强你的防御，减少相当于当前活力 %d%% 的伤害（目前为 %d 点），但不会减少超过原伤害的一半。此效果会消耗等同于 5%% 减少伤害值的活力。\n\t伤害值受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"696cdbed5d1a58579b75041f80f270270c13e56cd30ed7d46c1ba6dcec053dab","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"af6d0fc9aa14e5f134e093e790ab9fba95b8c5dc9f0b148d4953a7896fe179c3","logical_entry_identity":"fef026892df316f67909d482d76be0a48dd1f323eef452bffe10d66138424c18","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Spellpower increased by %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"法术强度增加 %d。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"71da8570c3817b8b66f321e4699864ef515280550c923ff552906d761bd183ea","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"af90b6afa0b4fa0458b8e65562c74ec61dc4fa6d30bb3dc42edb9b944199f661","logical_entry_identity":"dd88f77f9e3ea7f2138c1ec73e04275de7d7aaa4aea0f1b4225733e43971496f","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":" or ","source_tag":"_t","target":"或"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dd6adf6ae94284478ec5adf6c7ec0bd421faa02b9608251b1d44a39d31b0fd5e","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"af918013e6cf6b7daf714e7f0faf1fe8395ad38381770ebd71a9dbccc92a44e2","logical_entry_identity":"dae0cfb034a41aaeb9e4fd0512edb655a68d6d513f506ce7658bfcf65b2ca29d","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Teleports you randomly within a small range of up to %d grids with %d precision.\n\t\tIn the spot you left you will summon a random demon from your seeds for %d turns.\n\t\tIf the target area is not in line of sight, there is a chance the spell will fizzle.\n\t\tThis spell requires an unsummoned, alive, demon seed equiped in a worn equipment to work.\n\t\tThe range will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"传到 %d 码外的一个位置，误差 %d。\n\t\t在离开的位置，你将随机召唤一个恶魔，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t如果目标地点不在视线内，有一定几率失败。\n\t\t该技能需要你的装备上附着有至少一个未召唤的存活的恶魔种子。\n\t\t传送距离受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f903505e02faf6da7c1a37b9e4d92d5c3ddd0694434c56647b6bb5d4d982ce27","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"afbc14f0ad3a96da3cb8c68cd960fa2cf3779246a83cbfa1db1fbf7e547789c2","logical_entry_identity":"f467e22bb5958dd407dfeb05d380f3daba22c0692a114bd42fe389c5584eda79","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Cripple your enemies with vicious two-handed attacks.","source_tag":"_t","target":"用恶毒的双手攻击让敌人残废。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"99def969a8d6f9de39c789e727c2acf38a2d48f90e615b75503adc21f0160a38","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"afc0de6a798457030840907bb6fd729a4e0cb40533b819c9e83e6d4315f69b64","logical_entry_identity":"77c5ca5e31e2a6233662e7ea4fd075a61efe374586a84bdca4b1f8a7aee1f5c3","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Hits the target doing %d%% weapon damage. This attack cannot miss, and ignores all armor and resistances on the target. However, you take damage equal to %d%% of the damage dealt, or 30%% of your current HP, whichever is lower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"攻击目标，造成 %d%% 武器伤害。本次攻击必中，且无视目标护甲和抗性。\n\t但是，你自己会受到输出伤害的 %d%% 或者当前生命值 30%% 的伤害，取数值较低者。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bd1f1f3ac40d9a9dda3f204d060f703aee3b4a0dd3e5e795e1fa7e7c03395a65","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"b000bf2f57c552aa47e383f31126619a50f3a5376e114170bad2bc76985dc963","logical_entry_identity":"de088500e